  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "CMake: make PKCS support explicit",
  "description": "Introduce an option to explicitly enable/disable PKCS support in GnuTLS,\nregardless of whether it might be found automagically. This fixes the\ninconsistent GnuTLS ABI between build host and a client running Wireshark.",
